@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam roundCorner 20
title Создание и отображение задачи

participant User as "Пользователь"
participant Toolbar as "Toolbar.vue"
participant Canvas as "Canvas.vue"
participant Store as "Pinia Store"
participant API as "CanvasElementService"
participant Backend as "FastAPI"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL"

User -> Toolbar : кликает "➕ Задача"
Toolbar -> Canvas : emits add-card
Canvas -> Store : createCard({title, x, y})
Store -> API : запрос POST /api/cards

alt Успешно
  API -> Backend : POST /api/cards {title, x, y, z_index}
  Backend -> DB : INSERT INTO tasks
  DB --> Backend : возвращает Task
  Backend --> API : 200 OK {Task}
  API --> Store : store updated
  
  par Parallel updates
    Store --> Canvas : $subscribe (cards changed)
    Canvas -> Canvas : addNewElements()
    Canvas -> Canvas : createElement(card, 'task')
    Canvas -> Canvas : TaskCard.createGroup()
    Canvas -> Canvas : layer.add(group)
    Canvas -> Canvas : layer.draw()
  end
else Ошибка
  Backend --> API : 500 Error
  API --> Store : error
  Store --> Canvas : показать ошибку
end

note right of Canvas
  1. TaskCard создаёт Konva.Group
  2. Рисуется на canvas
  3. z-index обновляется
  4. Элемент отображается
end note

@enduml
